{"step_index":108,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:20:14Z","thinking":"**Verifying Suitcase Tile Colors**\n\nI'm currently focused on validating the color accuracy of the suitcase tiles. Specifically, I'm checking `index.html` to confirm that the eight suitcase tiles in Level 8 and all other levels precisely match the colors and stickers in the background artwork provided by the user, starting with Level 8's suitcases. This needs to be pixel-perfect.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"vi\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=3.0, user-scalable=yes, viewport-fit=cover\">\n    <title>Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay (Parent-Co-Play Interactive Book)</title>\n    <!-- Google Fonts Nunito với fallback hệ thống mượt mà -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@700;800;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"app-root\">\n        <!-- Canvas Pháo hoa, Sao lấp lánh & Trái tim -->\n        <canvas id=\"effects-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- TOP BAR: 8 LEVEL DOTS & CỔNG BA MẸ -->\n        <header class=\"top-nav\">\n            <nav class=\"stage-indicators\" aria-label=\"Tiến trình chuyến bay\">\n                <button class=\"stage-dot active\" data-screen=\"1\" aria-label=\"Level 1: Mặc đồ\">👕</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"2\" aria-label=\"Level 2: Xếp vali\">🧳</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"3\" aria-label=\"Level 3: Kiểm tra an ninh\">🎫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"4\" aria-label=\"Level 4: Tìm Cổng Bay\">🚪</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"5\" aria-label=\"Level 5: Hiệp sĩ đai\">🦸</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"6\" aria-label=\"Level 6: Ngắm mây\">☁️</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"7\" aria-label=\"Level 7: Lịch sự\">🤫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"8\" aria-label=\"Level 8: Nhận vali & Thưởng\">🏆</button>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây) -->\n            <button id=\"btn-parent-gate\" class=\"tycoon-btn parent-gate-btn\" aria-label=\"Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây)\">\n                <svg class=\"parent-hold-ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n                    <circle id=\"parent-ring-circle\" cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"26\"></circle>\n                </svg>\n                ⚙️ <span>Ba Mẹ</span>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- BIỂN BÁO LỜI THOẠI BA MẸ ĐỌC CHO BÉ (PARENT PROMPT BANNER) -->\n        <div class=\"parent-prompt-container\">\n            <div class=\"parent-prompt-signboard\">\n                <span id=\"parent-prompt-icon\" class=\"prompt-icon-badge\">👩</span>\n                <span id=\"parent-prompt-text\" class=\"prompt-speech-text\">“Bin sắp đi máy bay rồi. Con chọn bộ đồ nào giúp Bin dễ vận động nhé!”</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- VIEWPORT 8 MÀN CHƠI CHÍNH -->\n        <main class=\"screens-viewport\">\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 1: TRANG PHỤC THOẢI MÁI\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-1\" class=\"screen active\">\n                <div class=\"wardrobe-arena\">\n                    <!-- Tủ đồ 6 món trộn lẫn -->\n                    <div class=\"wardrobe-cabinet\">\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"shirt\" aria-label=\"Áo thun mềm\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👕</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Áo thun mềm</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"jeans\" aria-label=\"Quần bò cứng\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👖</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Quần bò bó</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"pants\" aria-label=\"Quần thun co giãn\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">🩳</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Quần thun êm</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"dress\" aria-label=\"Bộ liền rườm rà\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👗</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Bộ liền bó</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"shoes\" aria-label=\"Giày dán xé\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👟</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Giày dán tiện</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"boots\" aria-label=\"Giày nhiều dây\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">🥾</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Giày nhiều dây</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Nhân vật Bé Bin -->\n                    <div class=\"bin-character-frame\">\n                        <div id=\"bin-dress-target\" class=\"bin-avatar-card\">\n                            <div style=\"font-size: 66px;\">🧒</div>\n                            <div id=\"bin-slot-shirt\" class=\"bin-slot-item\">⚪</div>\n                            <div id=\"bin-slot-pants\" class=\"bin-slot-item\">⚪</div>\n                            <div id=\"bin-slot-shoes\" class=\"bin-slot-item\">⚪</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-1\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Đi Xếp Vali Nào! 🧳 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 2: CHIẾC VALI KỲ DIỆU\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-2\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"suitcase-arena\">\n                    <!-- Đồ vật bên trái -->\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Gấu bông\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">🧸</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Gấu bông</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Quần áo\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👕</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Quần áo</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"LEAVE_HOME\" aria-label=\"Kéo nhọn\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">✂️</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Kéo nhọn</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Vali Đỏ dán Sticker Gấu -->\n                    <div id=\"suitcase-target-lvl2\" class=\"suitcase-box-red\">\n                        <div class=\"suitcase-handle\"></div>\n                        <div id=\"suitcase-inner-lvl2\" class=\"suitcase-inner-grid\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"suitcase-bear-badge\">🐻</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Đồ vật bên phải -->\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Bàn chải\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">🪥</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Bàn chải</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"ASK_PARENT\" aria-label=\"Bình nước lớn\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">🍼</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Bình lớn</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Mũ che nắng\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👒</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Mũ che nắng</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-2\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Đến Sân Bay Thôi! 🚗 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 3: KIỂM TRA AN NINH\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-3\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"security-station-grid\">\n                    <!-- Trạm 1: Đưa vé -->\n                    <div class=\"station-pod\">\n                        <div style=\"font-size: 50px;\">👩‍✈️</div>\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; color: #1E88E5;\">1. Làm Thủ Tục Vé</span>\n                        <div id=\"pass-card-lvl3\" class=\"boarding-pass-chunky\">\n                            <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900;\">✈️ VÉ CỦA BIN</div>\n                            <div style=\"font-size: 26px; text-align: center;\">🎟️</div>\n                            <div id=\"stamp-badge-lvl3\" class=\"stamp-badge\">ĐÃ DUYỆT ✓</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Trạm 2: Máy soi chiếu dạ quang -->\n                    <div class=\"station-pod\">\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; color: #00897B;\">2. Máy Soi Chiếu</span>\n                        <div class=\"xray-screen-neon\">\n                            <div class=\"xray-tap-box\" data-item=\"🧸\">?</div>\n                            <div class=\"xray-tap-box\" data-item=\"👕\">?</div>\n                            <div class=\"xray-tap-box\" data-item=\"👒\">?</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"conveyor-belt\" style=\"width: 85%; margin-top: 6px;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Trạm 3: Cổng an ninh -->\n                    <div class=\"station-pod\">\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; color: #5E35B1;\">3. Cổng An Ninh</span>\n                        <div id=\"gate-detector-lvl3\" class=\"gate-detector-chunky\">\n                            <div class=\"gate-lamps-row\">\n                                <div class=\"gate-lamp-led\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"gate-lamp-led\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div id=\"bin-walker-lvl3\" class=\"kid-walker\" style=\"font-size: 54px;\">🧒</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-3\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Đi Tìm Cửa Bay Nào! 🚪 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 4: RA CỔNG BAY & NỐI VÉ ĐA NHÂN VẬT\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-4\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"boarding-hall-arena\">\n                    <!-- Hàng 4 nhân vật cầm vé -->\n                    <div class=\"characters-queue-row\">\n                        <button class=\"character-ticket-card\" data-char=\"rabbit\" data-gate=\"01\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 34px;\">🐰</span>\n                            <div>\n                                <strong>Bạn Thỏ</strong>\n                                <div style=\"color: #E65100; font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px;\">Vé 01</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"character-ticket-card\" data-char=\"bear\" data-gate=\"02\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 34px;\">🐻</span>\n                            <div>\n                                <strong>Bạn Gấu</strong>\n                                <div style=\"color: #E65100; font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px;\">Vé 02</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"character-ticket-card\" data-char=\"bin\" data-gate=\"03\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 34px;\">🧒</span>\n                            <div>\n                                <strong>Bé Bin</strong>\n                                <div style=\"color: #E65100; font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px;\">Vé 03</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"character-ticket-card\" data-char=\"dino\" data-gate=\"05\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 34px;\">🦖</span>\n                            <div>\n                                <strong>Khủng Long</strong>\n                                <div style=\"color: #E65100; font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px;\">Vé 05</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- 4 Cổng bay lớn phong cách BillionAir -->\n                    <div class=\"gates-array-row\">\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"01\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">01</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">🥕</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"02\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">02</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">🍯</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"03\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">03</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">✈️</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"05\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">05</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">🌲</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-4\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Vào Ghế Ngồi Thôi! ✈️ ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 5: HIỆP SĨ ĐAI AN TOÀN & UỐNG NƯỚC\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-5\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"cabin-seat-arena\">\n                    <!-- Ghế ngồi máy bay của Bin -->\n                    <div class=\"seat-plush-box\">\n                        <div id=\"safety-sign-lvl5\" class=\"safety-sign-led\">ĐÈN BÁO CÀI ĐAI</div>\n                        <div id=\"bin-seat-head\" style=\"font-size: 74px;\">🧒</div>\n                        <div id=\"bin-knight-cape\" class=\"knight-cape-icon\">🦸‍♂️</div>\n                        <div class=\"ear-soundwave left hidden\">〰️</div>\n                        <div class=\"ear-soundwave right hidden\">〰️</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Khóa đai & Nút uống nước -->\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n                        <div id=\"seatbelt-puzzle-lvl5\" class=\"seatbelt-puzzle\" style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); border-radius: 28px; padding: 16px; box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #CFD8DC;\">\n                            <div class=\"seatbelt-straps-row\">\n                                <div id=\"seatbelt-strap-lvl5\" class=\"strap-left\">\n                                    <div class=\"buckle-insert\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"strap-right\">\n                                    <div class=\"buckle-receiver\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <button id=\"btn-drink-water-lvl5\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-primary hidden\" style=\"font-size: 19px; padding: 14px;\">\n                            🥤 Uống một ngụm nước\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-5\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Ngắm Mây Qua Cửa Sổ! ☁️ ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 6: NGẮM MÂY BIẾN HÌNH\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-6\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"cloud-window-frame\">\n                    <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"bunny\">\n                        <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 54px;\">☁️</span>\n                        <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 1</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"car\">\n                        <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 54px;\">☁️</span>\n                        <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 2</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"watermelon\">\n                        <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 54px;\">☁️</span>\n                        <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 3</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"bear\">\n                        <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 54px;\">☁️</span>\n                        <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 4</span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-6\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Học Nói Nhỏ Nhé! 🤫 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 7: MÓN QUÀ LỊCH SỰ\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-7\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"etiquette-arena\">\n                    <!-- Tình huống 1: 3 Nút mức âm lượng -->\n                    <div class=\"etiquette-card-chunky\">\n                        <div style=\"font-size: 46px;\">👩‍🦰</div>\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 19px;\">Nói Nhỏ Nhẹ Nhàng</span>\n                        <div class=\"volume-emotion-options\">\n                            <button class=\"volume-emotion-btn\" data-level=\"loud\" aria-label=\"Nói to\">😮</button>\n                            <button class=\"volume-emotion-btn\" data-level=\"medium\" aria-label=\"Nói vừa\">🙂</button>\n                            <button class=\"volume-emotion-btn\" data-level=\"whisper\" aria-label=\"Nói khẽ\">🤫</button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Tình huống 2: Không đạp ghế trước -->\n                    <div class=\"etiquette-card-chunky\">\n                        <div style=\"font-size: 46px;\">💺</div>\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 19px;\">Không Đạp Lưng Ghế</span>\n                        <button id=\"bin-leg-target\" style=\"font-size: 50px; border: none; background: none; cursor: pointer;\" title=\"Chạm để thu chân\">\n                            👟🦶\n                        </button>\n                        <span id=\"leg-status-label\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #0277BD;\">Chạm để thu chân lại</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-7\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Máy Bay Hạ Cánh Rồi! 🛬 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 8: LẤY VALI & NHẬN PHẦN THƯỞNG\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-8\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"carousel-final-arena\">\n                    <!-- Bước 1: Máy bay dừng hẳn mới mở đai -->\n                    <button id=\"unbuckle-latch-btn\" class=\"tycoon-btn\" style=\"border: 3px dashed #78909C; font-size: 19px; padding: 14px 28px;\">\n                        <span>⏳ Máy bay đang chạy vào bãi đỗ...</span>\n                    </button>\n\n                    <!-- Băng chuyền hành lý (5 chiếc vali đầy màu sắc chuẩn ảnh minh họa) -->\n                    <div id=\"baggage-carousel-lvl8\" class=\"carousel-track-chunky hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"carousel-suitcases-track\">\n                            <!-- 1. Vali Đỏ dán Sticker Gấu của Bin -->\n                            <button class=\"carousel-bag-tile\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FF5252 0%, #D50000 100%); border: 4px solid #FFD54F;\" data-is-bin=\"true\" aria-label=\"Vali đỏ hình gấu\">\n                                <span>🐻</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <!-- 2. Vali Xanh dương dán Tên lửa -->\n                            <button class=\"carousel-bag-tile\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #29B6F6 0%, #0288D1 100%); border: 4px solid #FFF;\" data-is-bin=\"false\" aria-label=\"Vali xanh tên lửa\">\n                                <span>🚀</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <!-- 3. Vali Vàng dán Trái cherry -->\n                            <button class=\"carousel-bag-tile\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFEE58 0%, #FDD835 100%); border: 4px solid #FFF;\" data-is-bin=\"false\" aria-label=\"Vali vàng quả cherry\">\n                                <span>🍒</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <!-- 4. Vali Bạc dán Quả bóng đá -->\n                            <button class=\"carousel-bag-tile\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ECEFF1 0%, #B0BEC5 100%); border: 4px solid #FFF;\